# ~/.mcp/env/linear.env — Linear MCP reference (Keychain-backed, no file needed at runtime)
#
# The Linear MCP reads its API key from macOS Keychain, not this file.
# This file documents the Keychain item and setup command only.
#
# Setup (run once per machine):
#   make secrets-linear
#
# Or manually:
#   security add-generic-password -s "claude-mcp-linear" -a "claude-code" -w "YOUR_KEY" login.keychain
#
# Keychain item:
#   service  (-s): claude-mcp-linear
#   account  (-a): claude-code
#
# Team name is baked into the wrapper script (SpecterRealm) — no env override needed.
#
# Get your API key at: https://linear.app/settings/api
# "Personal API keys" section → create a new key
